        "node_id": "n_5_efef37",
        "thought_text": "I understand the issue. The current implementation generates all possible similar words, including those that are not valid words in the English language. This leads to incorrect results, as seen in the sample output where words like \"aad\" and \"aadd\" are included. To fix this, we need to modify our approach to only consider valid English words as similar. This can be achieved by using a dictionary of valid English words to filter the generated similar words.",
