        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The issue in the previous implementation was that it was not preserving the original capitalization of words when storing them in the word_cores dictionary. This led to incorrect output in the case where words with different capitalizations but the same core were present. To fix this, we should store the original words in the word_cores dictionary instead of just the cores. This will allow us to maintain the correct capitalization when generating the output.",
